index=entra sourcetype="azure:loganalytics:aadserviceprincipalsigninlogs" earliest=-1h latest=now
``` ========================================================================== ```
``` Detection (SPL): Contoso ITDR - Lab operator signs in from outside its allowlist ```
``` Lab:             Contoso Health Identity Platform - Splunk second SIEM     ```
``` KQL twin:        lab/kql/operator-signin-outside-allowlist.kql ```
``` -------------------------------------------------------------------------- ```
``` STAND-IN: Splunk Enterprise 60-day TRIAL. Written 2026-11-07 with the     ```
``` fourth ITDR set (review findings B1, B2, C5, D1).                         ```
``` DATA GAP, said plainly: neither the live feed (feed-splunk-live.py) nor ```
``` the replay (ingest-from-loganalytics.sh) carries this table today, so this ```
``` search has no rows to read. It runs and returns nothing until a feed sends ```
``` the table with this sourcetype. ```
``` Ids and allowlist: lookups contoso_operator_principals.csv (principal_id) and ```
``` contoso_operator_ips (CIDR, unexpired rows only); an empty ```
``` allowlist lookup means every operator sign-in alerts, as in the KQL twin. ```
``` ========================================================================== ```
``` @stanza Contoso ITDR - Lab operator signs in from outside its allowlist ```
``` @conf description = The lab operator service principal signed in from an IP outside the contoso_operator_ips lookup. KQL twin: lab/kql/operator-signin-outside-allowlist.kql ```
``` @conf disabled = 0 ```
``` @conf enableSched = 1 ```
``` @conf cron_schedule = */15 * * * * ```
``` @conf dispatch.earliest_time = -1h ```
``` @conf dispatch.latest_time = now ```
``` @conf counttype = number of events ```
``` @conf relation = greater than ```
``` @conf quantity = 0 ```
``` @conf alert.track = 1 ```
``` @conf alert.severity = 5 ```
``` @conf alert.expires = 7d ```
``` @conf alert.digest_mode = 0 ```
``` @conf alert.suppress = 1 ```
``` @conf alert.suppress.fields = IPAddress ```
``` @conf alert.suppress.period = 1h ```
``` @conf request.ui_dispatch_app = search ```
``` @conf request.ui_dispatch_view = search ```
| lookup contoso_operator_principals.csv principal_id AS ServicePrincipalId OUTPUT principal_id AS SpMatch
| lookup contoso_operator_principals.csv principal_id AS AppId OUTPUT principal_id AS AppMatch
| where isnotnull(SpMatch) OR isnotnull(AppMatch)
| lookup contoso_operator_ips IpRange AS IPAddress OUTPUT IpRange AS AllowedRange ExpiresOn
| eval LiveExpiry=mvfilter(strptime(ExpiresOn, "%Y-%m-%d") > now())
| where coalesce(mvcount(LiveExpiry), 0) == 0
| stats count AS SignIns, sum(eval(if(ResultType=="0",1,0))) AS Succeeded, values(ResultType) AS ResultTypes, min(_time) AS FirstSeenEpoch, max(_time) AS LastSeenEpoch BY ServicePrincipalId, ServicePrincipalName, AppId, IPAddress
| eval Severity=if(Succeeded > 0, "High", "Medium")
| eval TimeGenerated=strftime(LastSeenEpoch, "%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z"), FirstSeen=strftime(FirstSeenEpoch, "%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z"), LastSeen=TimeGenerated
| table TimeGenerated, Severity, ServicePrincipalName, ServicePrincipalId, AppId, IPAddress, SignIns, Succeeded, ResultTypes, FirstSeen, LastSeen
